FeatureName: Cut-Copy-Paste option

Description:
	Allows the user to select the shape and then either cut/copy the shape and paste it at a desired location on the
	canvas. Copying the shape means that the original shape stays on the canvas, whereas cutting the shape means that
	the original shape is removed from the canvas.


