FeatureName: Color Friendly Palette

Description:
	Implementing a color friendly palette for people with vision impairment problems(Deuteranopia, Protanopia and
	general low vision). This feature has been added as an accessibility feature to allow users with Deuteranopia(Red-
	Green color blindness), Protanopia(Red color blindness) and general low vision to be able to use the paint app
	effectively.

